# Docs first

Before creating or editing any lesson, slides, practice, or homework:

1. Read `docs/curriculum.md` (the Friday schedule and topics).
2. Read the previous session in `sessions/` so the new one builds on it.
3. Keep the curriculum and the session folders in sync. If a session's topic or homework changes, update `docs/curriculum.md`.
